= Configure.pl --gen-nqp bootstraps the nested nqp; the build written down
The jvm gen_nqp path builds the nested nqp checkout in place with
gradlew buildJvm (never cloning or moving it), so `perl Configure.pl
--backends=jvm --gen-nqp && make` is the whole chain again and the
Makefile exports RAKUDO_RAKUAST=1 itself. tools/build/jvm-build.sh and
jvm-build-resume.sh are the same steps written down. AGENTS.md gains the
working agreements: env-gated debug prints, -Ilib for in-tree module
use, the build through Configure.pl and make.
